  "topic_id": "t-mm-06-015",
  "book_id": "book-mm-06",
  "title": "15. STEPS OF POSTERIOR REPAIR:",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-015\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8841]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>15. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>STEPS OF POSTERIOR REPAIR:</strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8842]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Posterior repair steps:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8843]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The patient is placed in the dorsal lithotomy position. The pelvis and large intestine are prepared for surgery.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8844]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>A bimanual examination under general anesthesia is performed to differentiate between an enterocele and a rectocele.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8845]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Observation of the perineal body is made to determine the extent of reconstruction needed</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"fa3e5ca6eb01530bc3012183\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure fa3e5ca6eb01530bc3012183\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 3028950 2867025\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"3ef863be39001f8378defd16d87f3ffa955642869436c02b20e9504e77831ae7\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-7a1e88d83c5e81eef160\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2520680 0 L 2520680 2343053 L 0 2343053 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"7a1e88d83c5e81eef160\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-7a1e88d83c5e81eef160)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/f30adf91328d3785b3281021d8fbb4357cd21521df8c7c8f62d288c1e1121acc.jfif\" x=\"-1326863.81582558\" y=\"-5923580.94329807\" width=\"7686171.67251105\" height=\"13696457.59046005\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2520680 0 L 2520680 2343053 L 0 2343053 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8847]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8848]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The labia are retracted with interrupted sutures. The upper extent of the rectocele is identified. Allis clamps are applied to the posterior vaginal mucosa over this area. The clamps are elevated, creating a triangle.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8849]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8850]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8851]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8852]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"ade4df99f5150a010b3fc374\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure ade4df99f5150a010b3fc374\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 3257550 2581275\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"2594daa7a48c778a333937d8b6b1350f4ca8f5e91879f0ed91c6eb5f6d02a16a\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-9cf1fed51138f85bfe11\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2756154 0 L 2756154 2049598 L 0 2049598 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"9cf1fed51138f85bfe11\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-9cf1fed51138f85bfe11)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/74c8dedd935fcb04da6f4f22266400ca038d4cac98b3319ee69fee0050e642ed.jfif\" x=\"-1301250.28895646\" y=\"-5199703.04249192\" width=\"6813898.98390566\" height=\"12045830.14986776\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2756154 0 L 2756154 2049598 L 0 2049598 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8854]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Allis clamps are placed at the margins of the original hymen. An additional Allis clamp is placed in the midline at the top of the rectocele. A transverse incision is made at the posterior fourchette.</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>A Kelly clamp is inserted under the posterior vaginal mucosa, dissecting the posterior mucosa off the perirectal fascia. An additional incision is made in the perineal body, removing a triangular piece of skin, outlined by the dotted line. This will expose the insertion of the bulbocavernosus muscle. Only the skin of the perineal body should be removed, and care should be taken not to remove the underlying superficial transverse perineal muscles.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"c0aa9b7294d225762a0f0e38\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure c0aa9b7294d225762a0f0e38\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2895600 2390775\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"f26d7e8533ebf28463b376b9cfc2b36d4eb1514f818b26c7b17cd5b766261c8b\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-8eed3faf835020203397\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2400254 0 L 2400254 1872605 L 0 1872605 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"8eed3faf835020203397\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-8eed3faf835020203397)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/b269687201cc32e480f77328d4d50c520b8bad631d0b4ada267e6ade43db9f83.jfif\" x=\"-1167656.59127216\" y=\"-4497831.48451561\" width=\"6086299.66782463\" height=\"11621702.97275491\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2400254 0 L 2400254 1872605 L 0 1872605 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8856]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #404040; font-family: \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The vertical incision in the posterior vaginal mucosa has been made, and the edges are held with Allis clamps. The perirectal fascia is dissected off the posterior vaginal mucosa. The apex of the rectocele is held in an Allis clamp. The dissection of perirectal fascia off the vaginal mucosa is started with a scalpel but is completed with the handle of the scalpel or with scissors.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"870573b63a6afdcce0f3b25f\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 870573b63a6afdcce0f3b25f\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2924175 2705100\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"1f29bef992aa0c400ec3395f0807eb6f4a5159f88166564a671fb0b4a6919a66\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-b21e1245a94be618b39c\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2407197 0 L 2407197 2177995 L 0 2177995 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"b21e1245a94be618b39c\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-b21e1245a94be618b39c)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ff3455c1c956e0ecc519e6a61ece37f026b20ced96eb991d13216394d2b253f9.jfif\" x=\"-1365603.58991748\" y=\"-5999994.3043534\" width=\"8041950.35579461\" height=\"13964191.83176252\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2407197 0 L 2407197 2177995 L 0 2177995 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8858]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>A finger is placed over the rectocele, pushing it into the rectum, thus revealing the margins of the levator ani muscles. Already, number 1synthetic absorbable suture is passed through the margin of the levator ani from the apex down to the posterior fourchette. Bydepressing the anterior </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>rectal wall downward with one finger and elevating the previously placed suture, the surgeon sees the margin of the levator ani more clearly, and placement of sutures becomes easier.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8859]\">\u00a0</p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"7e0aa5f316f58d57f11b67ba\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 7e0aa5f316f58d57f11b67ba\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2752725 2409825\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"47ca7d058a81163400a558ab9b81678ae4988d5cbf5c112e303cb43532e33403\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-fba6275c49f3ac3373f5\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2241302 0 L 2241302 1888809 L 0 1888809 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"fba6275c49f3ac3373f5\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-fba6275c49f3ac3373f5)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ff3455c1c956e0ecc519e6a61ece37f026b20ced96eb991d13216394d2b253f9.jfif\" x=\"-1756592.19180433\" y=\"-13658403.09075631\" width=\"9617258.09912036\" height=\"16707731.09243698\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2241302 0 L 2241302 1888809 L 0 1888809 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8861]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>After all levator ani sutures have been placed, they are progressively tied.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"fdad19826d168bc9e641991b\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure fdad19826d168bc9e641991b\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2409825 2247900\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"f294fcc8538918a50776538d4e13200d43a1bc0c686978f2d85c95280d81e8a3\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-8a06ad93617a5c0e1dd8\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1891068 0 L 1891068 1723898 L 0 1723898 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"8a06ad93617a5c0e1dd8\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-8a06ad93617a5c0e1dd8)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c4e44429a704e274eebdb674e000e12de85e0d0a54f5565904862ba3ed0315f2.jfif\" x=\"-1532016.95899713\" y=\"-4727150.14544832\" width=\"8231339.77539828\" height=\"14749298.4257358\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1891068 0 L 1891068 1723898 L 0 1723898 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8863]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The excessive posterior vaginal mucosa has been trimmed away; the triangular defect in the perineal body can be seen. The insertion of the bulbocavernosus muscle is adjacent to the triangular defect in the perineal body.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"cf28f48f284189604a2d17db\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure cf28f48f284189604a2d17db\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2257425 2181225\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"18f7456e136d88ae21844223fd372f91bf8f4c5286fe3a815c4502f7c96ac8e0\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-f991f961b466f9f4c000\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1736624 0 L 1736624 1656918 L 0 1656918 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"f991f961b466f9f4c000\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-f991f961b466f9f4c000)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c4e44429a704e274eebdb674e000e12de85e0d0a54f5565904862ba3ed0315f2.jfif\" x=\"-1210309.98454502\" y=\"-6384934.51881829\" width=\"6846806.49739789\" height=\"11175758.80210442\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1736624 0 L 1736624 1656918 L 0 1656918 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8865]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The perirectal fascia is closed with interrupted 0 synthetic absorbable suture in the midline</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"2b1d2933de95ce40fb3a5520\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 2b1d2933de95ce40fb3a5520\" viewbox=\"-285750 -266700 2257425 2219325\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"388b1403d39d1315ef59f0325dcd08f391a8702573b95d75c068f875f2b7cabc\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-807dd451ca44c8509423\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1719816 0 L 1719816 1713982 L 0 1713982 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"807dd451ca44c8509423\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-807dd451ca44c8509423)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/bffa1c7274bfcf950284832c2fad19e7a517dc803de7ce47d3dc716e7dc95411.jfif\" x=\"-1050802.44460805\" y=\"-4259703.40606146\" width=\"6664145.38691053\" height=\"12024568.5421636\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1719816 0 L 1719816 1713982 L 0 1713982 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8867]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8868]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>A synthetic absorbable suture is placed at the apex of the vaginal mucosa and tied (a).</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The tail of the suture is left for a length of 20 cm.</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The suture (b) is placed superficial to the tail of the suture (a).</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"bde810d09331c9731d8c3520\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure bde810d09331c9731d8c3520\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2238375 2333625\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"ed81715ca00f74eaf61cfc6014a05610d8f4f49e7a5e1d23d0a1aa08d7fc3527\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-d7a52df547f31fdaeed1\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1734024 0 L 1734024 1834351 L 0 1834351 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"d7a52df547f31fdaeed1\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-d7a52df547f31fdaeed1)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/bffa1c7274bfcf950284832c2fad19e7a517dc803de7ce47d3dc716e7dc95411.jfif\" x=\"-1250925.67247265\" y=\"-8229026.97525241\" width=\"7588726.47702407\" height=\"13925081.60631595\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1734024 0 L 1734024 1834351 L 0 1834351 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8870]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The closure of the posterior vaginal wall is completed to the posterior fourchette. The former hymenal ring is reconstructed. The suture (b) is tied to the tail of the first suture (a) placed at the apex. The vaginal mucosa is approximated to the perirectal fascia to eliminate dead space</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"e0ff327db4d6913dc11e1363\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure e0ff327db4d6913dc11e1363\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2257425 2105025\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"70d64372e6d7fb4562c02f70a292eb7f65b10615bad9c66f34ceb1b7d9b42cc1\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-20528146e5ce2d23701e\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1755009 0 L 1755009 1587784 L 0 1587784 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"20528146e5ce2d23701e\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-20528146e5ce2d23701e)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/090b77344cac542da9979f75c76051325bcea112e68adf03f767cc8a2ad335ce.jfif\" x=\"-1118639.21115819\" y=\"-5056475.25156133\" width=\"6885628.53107345\" height=\"9916212.84036972\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1755009 0 L 1755009 1587784 L 0 1587784 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8872]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The same suture completes the closure of the perineal body. Several interrupted O synthetic absorbable sutures are placed in the insertions of the bulbocavernosus muscles to reconstruct the perineal body.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8873]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8874]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8875]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8876]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8877]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"3f6c023ecfad602a3acc0db8\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 3f6c023ecfad602a3acc0db8\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2200275 2333625\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"a17ae7601df34cc0017617b78d49b9651242169c44bd8b15ebe59860debbc40c\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-f6ddf31df00951821822\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1688424 0 L 1688424 1815787 L 0 1815787 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"f6ddf31df00951821822\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-f6ddf31df00951821822)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c878277f129c155114854b80cabdaeac64b6bc96e4a1fc4e5fb8e4400fbed3a9.jfif\" x=\"-1055688.35115044\" y=\"-5319662.22270204\" width=\"6640802.35988201\" height=\"12446274.59044486\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1688424 0 L 1688424 1815787 L 0 1815787 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8879]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The posterior vaginal mucosa suture (b) is placed in the subcutaneous tissue of the perineal body. Note that the suture marked a is still left long for eventual tying.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"dd3fca52cae5bf6531a74bbd\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure dd3fca52cae5bf6531a74bbd\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2314575 2200275\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"955e755dd10905a80f6d06fac5c5445e7d9775b40d97e3e2f355cfda25b5512d\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-3c2733553c1e4513583f\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1846328 0 L 1846328 1679279 L 0 1679279 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"3c2733553c1e4513583f\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-3c2733553c1e4513583f)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c878277f129c155114854b80cabdaeac64b6bc96e4a1fc4e5fb8e4400fbed3a9.jfif\" x=\"-1074749.44369354\" y=\"-7890515.53016617\" width=\"6177075.94513215\" height=\"11578838.86092532\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1846328 0 L 1846328 1679279 L 0 1679279 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8881]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The same suture (b) that completed the closure of the posterior vaginal wall is used to close the</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8882]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>subcutaneous tissue and the insertions of the bulbocave</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>rn</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>osus muscles.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8883]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The suture marked a is the long end of the tie at the apex of the posterior vaginal mucosa incision</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"161d6b58a116336a1d9bfad9\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 161d6b58a116336a1d9bfad9\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2505075 2247900\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"00b7cad00f2c97d87a63e92691ba4c8a153a15b232a8246a5ca22572f5a6f979\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-7a834e39434bbe500eb9\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2012743 0 L 2012743 1736486 L 0 1736486 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"7a834e39434bbe500eb9\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-7a834e39434bbe500eb9)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/cec2590d82282c4b9bc86e161d8517e0ac385f718b31eba2f7b98b2bec3dd010.jfif\" x=\"-945629.12044455\" y=\"-4566374.81662462\" width=\"6062113.72808867\" height=\"11528920.46209002\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2012743 0 L 2012743 1736486 L 0 1736486 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8885]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8886]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The subcuticular suture (b) is placed in the skin of the perineal body from the apex of the wound immediately above the anus to the posterior fourchette. At the posterior fourchette it is tied to suture a.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"454b5433a039d27cf448645a\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 454b5433a039d27cf448645a\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2486025 2371725\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"75295cd4b4128eb178400a3ff2f7af42a749454c7c4fdf97db9cfe3061647745\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-b316254b97be54de936f\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1971870 0 L 1971870 1837991 L 0 1837991 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"b316254b97be54de936f\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-b316254b97be54de936f)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/cec2590d82282c4b9bc86e161d8517e0ac385f718b31eba2f7b98b2bec3dd010.jfif\" x=\"-1123241.28788116\" y=\"-7720969.72342055\" width=\"6166911.64972635\" height=\"11729361.83790683\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1971870 0 L 1971870 1837991 L 0 1837991 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8888]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The completed operation is shown, with the rectocele reduced and the perineal body reconstructed. Vaginal packs are not required. Bladder catheterization is rarely indicated.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8889]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"3eda66e4ccd18bb892963d1f\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 3eda66e4ccd18bb892963d1f\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2809875 2466975\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"7de039b3be8a2dc48f340674548291cdd494b27f256fabc34a1c2977854ba7c6\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-7106f2f5d1f31f8d4d6b\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2274640 0 L 2274640 1943691 L 0 1943691 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"7106f2f5d1f31f8d4d6b\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-7106f2f5d1f31f8d4d6b)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/d8425710913c0dd56d731b25e75fe6a228e3bb3b0db77bc99677867d0b59efc6.jfif\" x=\"-962092.96762986\" y=\"-4343383.60658376\" width=\"5565413.12911355\" height=\"8452300.40006958\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2274640 0 L 2274640 1943691 L 0 1943691 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8891]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8892]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8893]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8894]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8895]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8896]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8897]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8898]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8899]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8900]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8901]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8902]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8903]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8904]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8905]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8906]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8907]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8908]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>",
